    <tags>terminal ssh sftp rdp session-manager foss cross-platform</tags>
    <summary>Cross-platform terminal and session manager with web/file browsers and AI.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Cross-platform terminal and session manager with web/file browsers and AI. Every connection you have, in one window. Written in Rust and Svelte.

This package runs the release's MSI installer (64-bit, for all users).

Sessions, tabs, trusted host keys and settings live in `%USERPROFILE%\.xtermium` (or wherever the `XTERMIUM_HOME` environment variable points), so upgrades and uninstalls keep them. Set a recovery passphrase (Settings > Security): it opens them if the keychain entry is lost.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/xtermium/xtermium/releases/tag/v0.9.0</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
